West: a mossling warren, and a hollow where lights float. East: kobolds. On the floor: a goblin camp. Up the west wall: an old crypt. Up the east wall: the orc hall. The warlord's temple lies behind the rockfall, and the way in runs through the orc hall.",[_[30]]="\"WHAT WE KNOW\
West: a mossling warren, and a hollow where lights float. East: kobolds. On the floor: a goblin camp. Up the west wall: an old crypt. Up the east wall: the orc hall. The warlord's temple lies behind the rockfall, and the way in runs through the orc hall.\"",[_[33]]=_[15]}},param2=2,param1=159,z=6,y=37},{x=43,name=_[13],param1=15,z=12,y=37},{x=43,name=_[13],param1=15,z=1,y=38},{x=43,name=_[13],param1=15,z=12,y=38},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=0,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=1,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=2,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=3,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=4,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=5,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=6,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=7,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=8,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=9,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=10,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=11,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=12,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=13,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=14,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=15,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=16,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=17,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=18,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=19,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=20,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=21,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=22,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=23,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=24,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=25,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=26,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=27,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=28,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=29,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=30,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=31,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=32,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=33,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=34,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=35,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=36,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=37,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=38,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=39,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=40,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=41,y=4},{x=44,name=_[25],param1=15,z=42,y=4},{x